  "description": "The Hover-1 Neo X is the pinnacle of streamlined design. Its striking frame not only enhances visual appeal, but also ensures effortless maneuverability, making every ride smooth and invigorating. Equipped with 8.5\" air-filled tires and a robust rear suspension system, the Neo X absorbs shocks with ease, delivering superior comfort across a variety of terrain. Its battery gets an upgrade over its Neo I and Neo V counterparts with 12 miles of range. The powerful 300W motor provides plenty of zip and gets Neo X up to 15 mph comfortably, while the rear drum brake delivers responsive stopping power. Bathed in the glow of bright white deck lights, Neo X adds style to daytime and nighttime visibility. Fold it down to conveniently store it at home or transport it to a scenic destination. The digital LED display keeps you informed with real-time updates on speed, speed mode, battery life, and more.",
